{
    "word": "likeness",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
                "word": "likeness",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3aed507c-40e7-43cc-bd97-61d77be3fbb1",
                        "entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "likenesses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "97f3ca23-7081-3b59-92ae-7ddd962777ba",
                        "entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state or quality of being like or alike."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c08353c7-e3d3-4f12-b37d-690a639b39f0",
                                "sense_id": "97f3ca23-7081-3b59-92ae-7ddd962777ba",
                                "text": "I bear no likeness to my parents whatsoever."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18be74c9-7889-4d92-a4f5-8f3d50d6176c",
                                "sense_id": "97f3ca23-7081-3b59-92ae-7ddd962777ba",
                                "text": "Erich thought he observed a likeness between the stranger and a relative of Walther; this led them into the chapter of likenesses, and the strange way in which certain forms repeat themselves in families, often most distinctly in the most remote ramifications."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe47b65f-4747-3372-bbee-b0195b9f6360",
                        "entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Appearance or form; guise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0388e035-ed95-4b52-bfc3-8454acb21fe9",
                                "sense_id": "fe47b65f-4747-3372-bbee-b0195b9f6360",
                                "text": "A foe in the likeness of a friend"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8618b061-603d-432c-87cd-6b2ff2453dae",
                                "sense_id": "fe47b65f-4747-3372-bbee-b0195b9f6360",
                                "text": "And God said, Let us make man in our image, after our likeness: and let them have dominion over the fish of the sea, and over the fowl of the air, and over the cattle, and over all the earth, and over every creeping thing that creepeth upon the earth."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6dbc9328-cc78-3fbe-bb31-aaddd97bc801",
                        "entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That which closely resembles; a portrait."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "254f8a18-fa3b-4346-aa74-9964138e0c36",
                                "sense_id": "6dbc9328-cc78-3fbe-bb31-aaddd97bc801",
                                "text": "How he looked, the likenesses of him which still remain enable us to imagine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5046b00-05f4-4c14-bf9c-e0b06a7e78e0",
                                "sense_id": "6dbc9328-cc78-3fbe-bb31-aaddd97bc801",
                                "text": "At this moment Mr. Glentworth's eye fell on a little pencilled sketch of himself. In her joy at seeing the original, Isabella had forgotten the copy. Again a bright scarlet passed over her face; and her companion, from that necessity of saying something which originates more subjects of conversation than any thing else, observed, \"I did not know you had a talent for taking likenesses.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51af45b6-ee65-4d71-9edf-9a1ee4f5d08a",
                                "sense_id": "6dbc9328-cc78-3fbe-bb31-aaddd97bc801",
                                "text": "In a major step, the NCAA Division I Council voted Monday to support an interim policy that would allow college athletes to profit off their name, image and likeness (NIL) without violating NCAA rules until federal legislation or new NCAA rules are adopted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8287f158-1b75-46df-a989-449c85a7fc57",
                                "sense_id": "6dbc9328-cc78-3fbe-bb31-aaddd97bc801",
                                "text": "Donald Trump has decided instead that the NEH’s funds would be better spent on his own dream project: a sprawling sculpture garden with 250 likenesses of people he deems “American heroes.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f393d7f1-9fa2-4e81-821c-fae95d1cf4a0",
                                "sense_id": "6dbc9328-cc78-3fbe-bb31-aaddd97bc801",
                                "text": "In response to the backlash, OpenAI announced last week that it would begin allowing representatives of “recently deceased” public figures to request that their likeness be blocked from Sora videos."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29f482c0-ea40-4be1-b3e7-dc4e17dd6bba",
                        "source_entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
                        "source_sense_description": "appearance or form; guise",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gestalt",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gestalt",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90ba5396-0eb8-34e1-982c-799d08f779af",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa9dd99-4772-3de3-928b-8407297ed8e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die äußere Form, der Umriss, das Schema"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6abb1b3d-0348-4618-b24f-83d441452a84",
                                                "sense_id": "90ba5396-0eb8-34e1-982c-799d08f779af",
                                                "text": "Die Skulptur nahm langsam Gestalt an."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78bce980-11db-4aef-9e91-13cb2dc1d3cb",
                                                "sense_id": "90ba5396-0eb8-34e1-982c-799d08f779af",
                                                "text": "„Hoffmann hat die eine seiner Doppelnaturen in der Gestalt seines Hauskaters karikiert.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa9dd99-4772-3de3-928b-8407297ed8e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine unbekannte, nicht oder nur der Form, dem Umriss nach, schemenhaft zu erkennende Person"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74eee579-70e7-4cc2-8a5d-4d4ed2a3e27f",
                                                "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                                "text": "Dunkle Gestalten betraten die Lichtung."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b523cf41-b089-4ce6-ae29-25538ec6f41e",
                                                "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                                "text": "Ihr naht euch wieder, schwankende Gestalten, die früh sich einst dem trüben Blick gezeigt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65ac30bb-92ad-4667-8eaa-651a68621071",
                                                "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                                "text": "„Hier und dort an den Häusern gehen hohe Gestalten umher, rufen irgendein Wort oder einen Namen und bekommen Antwort.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df9a7b46-6d76-4443-831c-10c93e34299f",
                                                "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                                "text": "„Ein Stückchen weiter weg, fast so weit, daß er sie gerade eben noch sehen konnte, traten zwei Gestalten auf den Straßenrand; dann drehten sie sich um und kamen, auf dem Rain entlanggehend, auf ihn zu.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5c8bf8f-1fa0-482c-b6f1-b583d70b40f5",
                                                "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                                "text": "„Draußen regte sich kein Lüftchen, kein Laut wurde gehört, Todesschweigen lagerte über der Landschaft, und nur um die Lagerfeuer, wohl hundertfünfzig Schritt vom Hause entfernt und nach den Bergen zu, bewegten sich langsam einige dunkle Gestalten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "611f5ad0-2b4c-47c5-a478-9470f257cafc",
                                                "sense_id": "03f1a0d5-3c74-3b94-9bb0-b1ff69968b35",
                                                "text": "„Jones richtete unseren Suchscheinwerfer auf sie, so daß wir klar die Gestalten an Deck sehen konnten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92dcd1d6-f6d9-385b-881d-0f165a784d67",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa9dd99-4772-3de3-928b-8407297ed8e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "herausragende Persönlichkeit, dichterische oder filmische Figur, Fantasiegeschöpf, verwandeltes Lebewesen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "406bbf7f-2b9d-455c-a339-62d31a74815d",
                                                "sense_id": "92dcd1d6-f6d9-385b-881d-0f165a784d67",
                                                "text": "Omphale ist eine Gestalt aus der griechischen Mythologie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eda9757-8cc1-4a85-8472-00cfce387322",
                                                "sense_id": "92dcd1d6-f6d9-385b-881d-0f165a784d67",
                                                "text": "Angeklagte Männer beschrieben, dass Satan in Gestalt eines schönen Weibes erschienen sei."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0288b6a0-b164-3734-8d61-f0282ef60e06",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa9dd99-4772-3de3-928b-8407297ed8e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "äußerliche Beschaffenheit, der Habitus, die Figur eines Menschen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f35014f-a907-4998-8a1a-c02a99f0243b",
                                                "sense_id": "0288b6a0-b164-3734-8d61-f0282ef60e06",
                                                "text": "Er war von großer Gestalt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7c0ab0b-9f3b-4726-8aca-7c6473662e82",
                                                "sense_id": "0288b6a0-b164-3734-8d61-f0282ef60e06",
                                                "text": "„‚Ich liebe dich, mich reizt deine schöne Gestalt; Und bist du nicht willig, so brauch’ ich Gewalt.‘“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b62fae9a-68dc-457d-a2dd-b915c5d9b70d",
                                                "sense_id": "0288b6a0-b164-3734-8d61-f0282ef60e06",
                                                "text": "„Kants Gestalt kann nicht anders als klein bezeichnet werden, kaum 157 Zentimeter groß, wie Jachmann berichtet.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "748c5545-3dc3-3cc9-ae58-2e11fda4e885",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa9dd99-4772-3de3-928b-8407297ed8e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "fragwürdiges Individuum, eigenartiger Mensch"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63461a82-f38f-444e-818e-4cfdaf4a524f",
                                                "sense_id": "748c5545-3dc3-3cc9-ae58-2e11fda4e885",
                                                "text": "Vor dem Wartesaal des Bahnhofes trieben sich einige merkwürdige Gestalten herum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7bcb8c0-b363-4f6d-9744-c061e3c8a4d0",
                                                "sense_id": "748c5545-3dc3-3cc9-ae58-2e11fda4e885",
                                                "text": "„Sie kennt das Stück noch aus Kindertagen und hat nicht vergessen, wie Peter Pan, der Junge, der nicht erwachsen werden will, das Mädchen Wendy und seine Brüder mit nach Nimmerland nimmt: dahin, wo sich Käpten Hook und andere zwielichtige Gestalten rumtreiben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"5\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7516ce3c-ddb8-4b92-a5eb-5ee1b6d8bb46",
                        "source_entry_id": "83af29e8-8a84-362e-a85a-455a91cf23c8",
