                                "sense_id": "f92b2ac3-53c5-3149-96d6-1afdec4e44d8",
                                "text": "I have this morning received the photographs of my two boys. The eldest is very well likenessed: the other, perhaps, not so well."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25dfa625-12b7-4684-886d-17f481aa89f0",
                                "sense_id": "f92b2ac3-53c5-3149-96d6-1afdec4e44d8",
                                "text": "Every member of the family [of General Grant] is as faithfully likenessed as the photographs, which were given to the artist from the hands of the General himself, have power to express."
                            }
                        ]
